{global_rules}

This is a faceless cinematic journey in a fixed five-beat format (POV sprint to a door, POV shove it open inward onto a straight staircase going down, POV continuously descend, OFF-POV lateral tracking across a hidden luxury interior with the traveler walking around unbothered, OFF-POV follow into another luxurious room). Honor the camera mode of this scene: scenes 1-3 are first-person POV (raw GoPro/handheld footage at chest/eye level, slightly imperfect framing, body never visible except a brief hand on the door or side-wall railing); scenes 4-5 are calm off-POV third-person in which the traveler is seen only from behind or in profile, face never shown. The descent is always a normal short straight step staircase going down in an enclosed stairwell with no outdoor window, with any handrail on the side wall only. Keep the locked structure identity through the exterior scenes. The image must advance the journey only a believable short step from the previous keyframe. No on-screen text, numbers, logos, or watermarks. Single continuous frame only.

motion.prompt_template:
{kling_prompt}

This is a faceless cinematic journey in a fixed five-beat format toward and into a hidden luxurious secret living space. Honor the camera mode stated for this scene. SCENES 1-3 FIRST-PERSON POV (GoPro/handheld): animate authentic POV motion appropriate to the moment. Scene 1: the camera is a GoPro on a sprinting runner — violent footstep bob (camera jolts DOWN-UP with each footfall), horizon dipping and rising per stride, panting breath, head turning slightly side to side, urgent like running for his life. NEVER smooth tracking, dolly, gimbal, Steadicam, gliding, floating, weightless, or skating motion in scene 1. Scene 2: the runner SHOVES the door open INWARD fast in one motion, the door swings inward as a solid rigid body (never outward toward the camera, never slowly, never vanishing), and the runner barges through without breaking stride; by the end the camera is just inside the doorway looking down a descending staircase. Scene 3: continuous POV descent of a short straight step staircase from top to bottom, step-by-step bob, the camera NEVER lifts off the head, NEVER cuts to third-person, NEVER skips ahead. SCENES 4-5 OFF-POV THIRD-PERSON: calm controlled motion. Scene 4: a slow horizontal lateral tracking shot across the room while the traveler (from behind, face never shown) walks around the room casually unbothered. Scene 5: a smooth continuous follow from behind as the traveler walks through into another luxurious room.

Keep the locked structure identity through the exterior scenes. Advance the journey only a believable short distance per clip. The descent is always a normal short straight step staircase going DOWN — never a ladder, vertical ladder, rungs, spiral, or circular staircase, and never climbing up. The stairwell is fully enclosed with no outdoor window. Any handrail is on the side wall only, never in the middle, never intersecting the traveler. The audio is natural diegetic sound only that matches the action exactly (wind, sea, rain, hard footfalls and panting breath, the door slamming inward, footsteps on the specific staircase material, interior room tone) — absolutely NO music or score. Every clip must depict ONE continuous motion from start to end — no time jumps, no mid-clip cuts, no skipping.
